@startuml
title Stays4Pilgrims - System Overview

top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 180
skinparam dpi 180

actor "Pilgrim / Host / Admin" as User

rectangle "Client Layer" as CLIENT {
	component "Stays4Pilgrims Frontend\n(Flutter Web / Mobile)" as Frontend
}

rectangle "Application Layer" as APP {
	component "Stays4Pilgrims Backend\n(NestJS REST API)" as Backend
}

rectangle "Data Layer" as DATA {
	database "PostgreSQL" as DB
}

User --> Frontend : Browse, authenticate\ncontribute content
Frontend --> Backend : HTTPS requests\n(JSON REST)
Backend --> DB : SQL queries\n(transactions)

note right of Backend
Core domains:
- Auth and Accounts
- Accommodations and Comments
- Upload and Moderation
- Suggestions and Contact
end note

@enduml
